classDiagram
  class V4Workflow {
    +initialize_payload()
    +request_message()
    +action_from_response()
    +run()
  }
  class Scenario {
    +slots
    +nights
    +score_config
  }
  class WeatherTruth {
    +segments()
    +band_quality()
    +report_fault()
  }
  class BestLedger {
    +record()
    +best()
    +max_factors()
    +request_factors()
    +invalidate_window()
  }
  class Runner {
    <<module>>
    +run_scenario()
    +normalize_action()
  }
  class Scorer {
    <<module>>
    +score_target_exposure()
    +observation_request_status()
    +required_penalty()
    +uniformity_penalty()
  }
  V4Workflow --> Runner : 协议桥接
  Runner --> Scenario : 加载完整卡
  Runner --> WeatherTruth : 仅可信后端读取
  Runner --> BestLedger : 有效观测账本
  Runner --> Scorer : 命中后计分与终局结算
  Scorer --> WeatherTruth : 分段质量
  Scorer --> BestLedger : 请求与罚分
